503
00:31:03,360 --> 00:31:08,800
And then by the law of iterated expectations, what we can do is basically say the expectation

504
00:31:08,800 --> 00:31:14,160
of this return is the same as the expectation of this return, that's called the law of iterated

505
00:31:14,160 --> 00:31:18,880
expectations, which gives us this final line here, which tells us that the value function

506
00:31:18,880 --> 00:31:24,240
