01:23:44,200 --> 01:23:47,120
We'll take you to one of these chance nodes here,

1839
01:23:47,120 --> 01:23:48,400
one of these action nodes.

1840
01:23:49,400 --> 01:23:52,520
And we can say, when we reach that action,

