01:23:57,360 --> 01:23:59,360
We can say this had a number on the red arc,

1844
01:23:59,360 --> 01:24:01,680
which was eight and this had a number on the red arc,

1845
01:24:01,680 --> 01:24:03,520
which was 10 or whatever it was.

1846
01:24:03,520 --> 01:24:05,320
And now what we do is instead of taking

1847
01:24:05,320 --> 01:24:06,560
the average of these guys,

1848
01:24:06,560 --> 01:24:08,600
we take the max over these guys.

1849
01:24:08,600 --> 01:24:10,040
So we're basically saying,

1850
01:24:10,040 --> 01:24:13,120
look at the value of each of the actions you can take

