01:24:14,320 --> 01:24:15,520
And that's going to tell you how good it is

1853
01:24:15,520 --> 01:24:16,800
to be in this state here.

1854
01:24:17,760 --> 01:24:19,720
It's simply the max of all the Q values.

1855
01:24:20,920 --> 01:24:22,120
If I can go left, I can go right.

1856
01:24:22,120 --> 01:24:23,800
I look at how much reward I get in each case

1857
01:24:23,800 --> 01:24:26,000
and I pick the one that gives me the most.

