01:25:23,600 --> 01:25:25,120
the optimal value of each of those states

1887
01:25:25,120 --> 01:25:26,320
that we might end up in.

1888
01:25:27,320 --> 01:25:30,120
And if we know the value of each of those states

1889
01:25:30,120 --> 01:25:31,280
that we might end up in,

1890
01:25:31,320 --> 01:25:32,960
we just need to average over them now.

1891
01:25:32,960 --> 01:25:33,800
There's no max here.

1892
01:25:33,800 --> 01:25:35,920
We don't get to pick where the wind blows us.

1893
01:25:35,920 --> 01:25:37,480
We have to average over all the things

1894
01:25:37,480 --> 01:25:38,960
the environment might do to us.

1895
01:25:38,960 --> 01:25:41,600
And that tells us how good our action is.

1896
01:25:41,600 --> 01:25:44,960
So our action is the optimal action value.

1897
01:25:44,960 --> 01:25:46,560
It's just the immediate reward

1898
01:25:46,560 --> 01:25:49,320
