1899
01:25:49,320 --> 01:25:50,720
that the wind might blow us left,

1900
01:25:50,720 --> 01:25:53,240
the probability that the wind might blow us right,

1901
01:25:53,240 --> 01:25:55,920
multiplied by the optimal value of being in that state.

1902
01:25:57,320 --> 01:25:58,160
Okay?

1903
01:25:58,360 --> 01:26:03,360
And again, what we can do is put those two pieces together.

1904
01:26:03,960 --> 01:26:05,360
When you put those two pieces together,

